e=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>D</mi></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">F</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>So, only Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;will be false.</p>"
